# ServiceNow Deactivate Duplicate Users

## Project Overview
This project automates the process of identifying and deactivating duplicate users in the ServiceNow platform based on their email address.

## Problem Statement
- Users with duplicate emails should be deactivated.
- The solution automates this process to ensure data consistency.

## Steps
1. Query the `sys_user` table for active users.
2. Check the email addresses for duplicates.
3. Deactivate users with duplicate emails, except the first one.

## Script

```javascript
// Query to get all active users
var gr = new GlideRecord('sys_user');
gr.addQuery('active', true);  // Only active users
gr.query();
var emailMap = {};

while (gr.next()) {
    var email = gr.email;
    if (emailMap[email]) {
        gr.active = false;  // Deactivate the duplicate user
        gr.update();
    } else {
        emailMap[email] = true;
    }
}
